WEBVTT

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:14.300
Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
aoku nemuru mizu no hoshi ni sotto

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:22.680
Kissing softly the star of water that sleeps in blue,

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
kuchizuke shite inochi no hi wo tomosu hito yo

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:31.410
A person who lights the fire of life,

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
toki to iu kin'iro no sazanami wa

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.300
The time, the golden ripple,

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
oozora no kuchibiru ni umareta toiki ne

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:45.070
is a sigh from the lips of the sky,

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
kokoro ni uzumoreta

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:49.300
The stars of kindness...

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
yasashisa no hoshitachi ga

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.270
...buried in heart flame up...

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
honoo age yobiau

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.440
...and call to each other,

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
namima sasurau nanpasen no you ni

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:03.430
Like wrecked ships wandering on the waves...

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
mou nakanaide ima

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:08.870
Don't cry, any more,

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
anata wo sagashite iru hito ga iru kara

00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:16.240
because now there is a person looking for you,

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
omae ni aitai yo to

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.970
Dying to see you...

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:37.060
Scirocco murdered Jamitov Hymem,
leader of the Titans...

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:41.990
...but Haman Karn in turn broke off
ties with Scirocco...

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:44.160
...in favor of reviving
the Zabi Family on her own.

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:47.840
During the ensuing battle,
Sarah Zabiarov lost her life...

00:01:48.110 --> 00:01:50.080
...and left Katz in the depths of sorrow.

00:01:50.270 --> 00:01:55.120
A Descent into the Maelstrom

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:09.860
Kamille! Kamille!

00:02:10.430 --> 00:02:11.400
Haro!

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:17.360
What's the matter?

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:20.170
I have to be on my way.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:22.130
We know.

00:02:22.210 --> 00:02:24.340
I'll play with you when I return.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:25.340
Really?!

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:27.450
Yes, really. So...!

00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:30.450
Make sure you come back, Kamille!

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.150
Shinta, you're...!

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:34.690
What's gotten into you?

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:36.220
Don't give Fa a hard time.

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:37.650
Kamille!

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:40.960
<i>The Zeta's leaving on the first wave,</i>
<i>got that?!</i>

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:44.730
Katz?

00:02:44.800 --> 00:02:47.530
<i>Why do you launch first,</i>
<i>Kamille?!</i>

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:49.430
<i>We already discussed this!</i>

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:50.730
<i>Out of my way!</i>

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.700
Katz! What are you doing?!

00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:03.010
It has the same targeting system
as the Grenade Launcher?

00:03:03.380 --> 00:03:04.410
<i>That's right.</i>

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:05.710
And the rope will shoot okay?

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:07.450
There's no flaws in the design.

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:09.550
The rest depends on your skill, Kamille.

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:16.690
Zeta Gundam! Kamille, let's do it!

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.260
Let go of me!

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:21.890
You can't go without permission,
can you?!

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:22.940
I just do!

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:23.970
Fa!

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:25.910
Katz!

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:28.330
I'm worried about Kamille.

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:30.300
For what reason?

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:33.310
Hey, the G-Defenser is moving.

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:35.850
I thought orders were only given for
the Zeta to launch.

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:38.210
Who's piloting the G-Defenser?!

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:40.380
<i>I'm at the gate! I'm taking off!</i>

00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:41.420
<i>Katz?</i>

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:45.720
I'm not letting Kamille go out alone!

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:48.820
I'm the one who must avenge
Sarah's death!

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:50.820
G-Defenser, taking off!

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:57.670
Is it Katz?!

00:03:57.740 --> 00:03:59.000
What?! The Methuss, too?!

00:03:59.070 --> 00:04:00.040
Fa!

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:08.570
Drat!

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:10.140
Shall I go?

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:11.740
No. There's no need!

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:15.310
It's the right sized force
for a diversion for...

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:16.650
...Operation Maelstrom.

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:18.710
Do we need three for that, captain?!

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:20.520
Leave it as is!

00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:22.430
Kamille will handle things fine.

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:23.960
Are you sure?

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:25.090
Let's hope so.

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:29.400
All vessels, proceed toward Gryps 2
at top speed!

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:31.500
Commence Operation Maelstrom!

00:04:38.510 --> 00:04:39.980
Damn Katz and Fa!

00:04:40.150 --> 00:04:41.980
I'll "correct" them when they return!

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:53.650
Katz! What's wrong?!

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:55.250
I'm on my way to kill Haman!

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:57.460
We're at war, Katz!

00:04:57.760 --> 00:04:59.390
Sarah died because of her!

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:02.760
<i>By bringing emotions into battle</i>
<i>you'll end up destroying yourself!</i>

00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:06.130
We can fight because we hate!

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:07.100
Katz!

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:13.280
Kamille!

00:05:13.650 --> 00:05:15.910
<i>If you don't listen to me,</i>
<i>I'm going to shoot you!</i>

00:05:18.850 --> 00:05:20.680
Kamille. Are you serious?

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:22.620
Of course I am!

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:25.620
You can't get in my way during the battle
for your selfish reasons!

00:05:26.460 --> 00:05:27.430
Kamille...!

00:05:31.270 --> 00:05:32.230
Fa?

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:37.870
Can you restrain yourself in the same way
you're restraining Katz, Kamille?!

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:41.870
You're tired of all this fighting too, Fa?!

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.570
I'm trying to end this war quickly!

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:46.710
But you alone can't handle this
diversionary operation, can you?!

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:48.010
<i>Don't follow!</i>

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:50.520
<i>You guys join the main force</i>
<i>of Operation Maelstrom!</i>

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:54.550
Katz!

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:56.020
I won't get in Kamille's way.

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:57.980
I'll draw Haman's attention.

00:05:58.490 --> 00:05:59.550
No problem with that, right?!

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:32.620
Main cannons in firing range
in three minutes!

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:34.860
Mobile suits, ready for take-off!

00:06:35.230 --> 00:06:37.560
Scan of obstacles ahead complete!

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:38.890
All clear!

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:41.390
Okay, send out mobile suit teams!

00:06:41.740 --> 00:06:43.330
Commencing Operation Maelstrom!

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:46.400
Quattro Bajeena! Hyaku Shiki, launching!

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:52.470
Gundam Mk. II! Emma, taking off!

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:59.010
Rick Dias, taking off!

00:07:12.130 --> 00:07:14.000
They're firing at us from that far?

00:07:14.070 --> 00:07:15.500
They're not accustomed to
actual battle.

00:07:18.070 --> 00:07:20.060
Lieutenant Botty, follow me.

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:24.270
Our initial target is the colony's
microwave retriever panel.

00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:25.510
Roger!

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:34.320
They're coming!

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:35.720
I'll distract the enemy's attention!

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:42.790
Mobile suit team has encountered
the enemy units!

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:44.760
Begin firing!

00:07:44.830 --> 00:07:46.390
Maintain battle speed!

00:07:46.470 --> 00:07:47.590
Take the planned course!

00:07:58.610 --> 00:08:01.600
Number Five Team, your anti-air fire
is getting in the way!

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:04.750
The mobile suits of the Number Seven Team
are unable to launch!

00:08:04.820 --> 00:08:07.620
The strength of our forces
has an overwhelming advantage.

00:08:08.460 --> 00:08:10.360
Endure their initial attack,
and we'll be fine.

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:11.390
Yes, ma'am!

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:14.690
They're getting through
because our formation is full of gaps.

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:18.720
Damn A.E.U.G....!
They can deploy their fleet swiftly.

00:08:21.940 --> 00:08:23.400
Wh-What's this?!

00:08:23.470 --> 00:08:25.440
I'm getting goosebumps.

00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:27.570
Why in the world?!

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:38.550
Yes, I'm sure of it.

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:39.850
Haman's in there.

00:08:41.390 --> 00:08:43.580
I know she'll come out.

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:45.520
Hurry out, Haman!

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:55.530
Is that it?

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:01.300
<i>Lieutenant.</i>

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:03.340
<i>I destroyed Gryps 2's</i>
<i>circuit breaker!</i>

00:09:03.880 --> 00:09:06.510
Good! We've cut off their
electrical system!

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:09.480
How dare you damage the panels!

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:13.850
You're not getting away!

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:21.330
To hell with this Colony Laser.

00:09:21.390 --> 00:09:23.420
It's only great in size. It's useless!

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:33.970
Wow! Has the fighting already begun?!

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:37.240
- This is no place for children.
- What is "Maelstrom"?!

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:38.110
Why now?

00:09:38.180 --> 00:09:40.650
A maelstrom is a giant whirlpool.

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:42.170
Look!

00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:44.880
We surround the enemy's colony
like a whirlpool.

00:09:45.450 --> 00:09:47.580
Then we conquer the enemy's colony.

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:49.850
So that's why it's called
Operation Maelstrom!

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:50.820
Right.

00:09:50.890 --> 00:09:52.720
Let's go tell Dr. Hasan!

00:09:52.790 --> 00:09:54.350
He'll give us candy for it!

00:09:54.430 --> 00:09:56.160
Remain in the doctor's office!

00:09:56.800 --> 00:09:58.960
Is this a nursery?

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:01.770
Don't let up on the barrage!

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:10.680
Haman.

00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:13.070
What's taking her?

00:10:13.810 --> 00:10:16.750
The A.E.U.G.'s fleet has surrounded Gryps 2!

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:18.750
Is our own fleet sleeping or something?!

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:21.220
Can't anyone break through their line?

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:23.480
Captain, get the Qubeley ready for take-off!

00:10:24.960 --> 00:10:28.090
We're letting them dictate the battle.
I can't watch any more of this.

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:29.150
Miss Haman!

00:10:34.970 --> 00:10:36.030
Miss Mineva.

00:10:36.340 --> 00:10:38.330
This is the last place I want to see her.

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:41.000
Why did you bring her here?!

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:43.170
Haman, where are you planning to go?

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:44.370
Miss Mineva...!

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:46.540
I'm feeling sick.

00:10:46.610 --> 00:10:48.270
This uncomfortable feeling.

00:10:48.350 --> 00:10:49.820
I don't want you to go anywhere.

00:10:51.020 --> 00:10:54.110
Your ability to sense the situation
often surprises me.

00:10:54.190 --> 00:10:58.150
As you guessed, our ship is
presently in a battle with the A.E.U.G..

00:10:58.230 --> 00:10:59.250
That's not what I'm sensing.

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:03.530
I'm feeling the same discomfort
I felt before on the Gwadan.

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:06.330
I felt it the time I saw Char after years.

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:10.400
<i>Goosebumps?</i>

00:11:10.470 --> 00:11:13.100
<i>Then is Miss Mineva</i>
<i>feeling the same thing?</i>

00:11:14.010 --> 00:11:15.630
There's nothing to worry about.

00:11:16.810 --> 00:11:21.140
Once we sink the Argama, the A.E.U.G.
will be like a ship without its helmsman.

00:11:21.210 --> 00:11:23.240
When that happens,
Axis will be in control.

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:26.210
If needed, I'm certain Char will help us.

00:11:26.690 --> 00:11:27.740
Char?!

00:11:27.820 --> 00:11:29.150
He's a man we can rely on!

00:11:29.320 --> 00:11:30.720
It's dangerous here.

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:32.520
Please leave this area.

00:11:32.590 --> 00:11:34.560
I'll report to you later.

00:11:34.900 --> 00:11:37.160
So you are taking off, Haman?

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:39.430
I shall see you shortly.

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:45.830
The Number Eight Squadron will
accompany you, Miss Haman!

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:48.670
- I'll leave that to you.
- Yes, ma'am!

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:56.780
What's this sensation?

00:11:56.850 --> 00:11:58.250
It's the same as earlier.

00:12:19.470 --> 00:12:21.630
Someone's watching me.

00:12:21.710 --> 00:12:24.610
<i>Miss Haman. An enemy mobile armor</i>
<i>is approaching!</i>

00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:26.380
I see!

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:27.880
Qubeley, taking off!

00:12:31.990 --> 00:12:32.920
The Qubeley?

00:12:32.990 --> 00:12:34.580
It's Haman!

00:12:39.430 --> 00:12:40.550
No.

00:12:40.630 --> 00:12:42.860
That pressure I felt earlier
didn't come from this one.

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:55.970
Katz!

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:56.770
Fa?

00:12:56.840 --> 00:12:57.740
<i>Katz, over here!</i>

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:03.580
How dare you!

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:04.620
<i>Haman!</i>

00:13:10.590 --> 00:13:11.560
Char?!

00:13:11.730 --> 00:13:12.590
No, it isn't!

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:13.920
Who is it?!

00:13:25.310 --> 00:13:26.140
Haman Karn!

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:29.070
You're the source who causes
us all to fight!

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:30.600
We can't allow you to live!

00:13:30.940 --> 00:13:32.040
You're that Newtype.

00:13:45.460 --> 00:13:46.450
Haman!

00:13:46.530 --> 00:13:48.020
You make people miserable!

00:13:50.530 --> 00:13:51.790
Shut your mouth, vulgar boy!

00:13:58.970 --> 00:14:01.240
You're finished, punk.

00:14:05.950 --> 00:14:06.910
Wh-What's this?

00:14:10.420 --> 00:14:11.750
This sensation.

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:21.590
What was that I just felt?

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:39.640
Where... am I?

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:11.070
Who is it?

00:15:11.140 --> 00:15:13.610
It's not Fa. It's not Rosamia either.

00:15:14.150 --> 00:15:15.110
Is it Miss Reccoa?!

00:15:17.280 --> 00:15:19.270
Mom?! But it can't be!

00:15:24.220 --> 00:15:27.060
But it's someone I met long ago...

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:29.060
...or at least it feels that way.

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:31.560
Char?!

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:33.260
Scirocco?!

00:15:33.600 --> 00:15:35.590
What's going on here?

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:45.270
Mom?!

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:48.110
That's me!

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:49.580
Why?!

00:15:50.320 --> 00:15:51.650
Why is it?!

00:16:02.530 --> 00:16:03.790
That's me.

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:05.230
A dream?

00:16:05.300 --> 00:16:06.420
<i>But...!</i>

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:17.510
<i>We saw the same thing?</i>

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:19.800
<i>They're simply memories.</i>

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:22.070
<i>So people can understand each other!</i>

00:16:22.150 --> 00:16:23.640
<i>Understand... each... other?</i>

00:16:24.980 --> 00:16:26.540
<i>Is that what this is?</i>

00:16:26.620 --> 00:16:28.180
<i>That's right!</i>

00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:29.680
<i>Don't get cozy with me!</i>

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:33.090
Zeta!

00:16:33.730 --> 00:16:35.750
Is it you that's been deluding me?!

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:39.530
Was I just having a dream?

00:16:41.670 --> 00:16:43.070
Stop it, Haman!

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:46.670
How dare you meddle with my mind!

00:16:46.740 --> 00:16:47.570
You should be ashamed!

00:16:47.640 --> 00:16:48.470
Vulgar boy!

00:16:53.410 --> 00:16:54.180
Stop it!

00:16:54.250 --> 00:16:56.240
We may be able to
understand each other!

00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:57.680
Until we got here...!

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:58.680
Shut up!

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:00.450
You're no different from Char!

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:06.650
You may very well be gifted...

00:17:07.430 --> 00:17:09.400
...but I cannot forgive you
for your insolence!

00:17:11.930 --> 00:17:12.990
<i>Die!!</i>

00:17:16.440 --> 00:17:17.400
What?!

00:17:19.570 --> 00:17:20.500
Sarah!

00:17:20.570 --> 00:17:22.100
I can now avenge your death!

00:17:22.440 --> 00:17:23.410
Damn rat!

00:17:25.280 --> 00:17:26.610
What are you doing here, Katz?!

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:29.550
It's all your fault!

00:17:32.720 --> 00:17:33.480
What?!

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:41.850
Haman! Stop it!

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:47.220
Kamille!

00:17:47.300 --> 00:17:48.160
Fa?!

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:53.170
Fa...!

00:17:56.410 --> 00:17:58.500
Haman Karn! I know now!

00:17:58.580 --> 00:18:00.510
You don't deserve to live!

00:18:07.090 --> 00:18:08.210
What?

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:13.290
Return to your world of darkness,
Haman Karn!

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:16.620
You're taking this Qubeley
a little too lightly.

00:18:19.230 --> 00:18:19.960
Now!

00:18:26.070 --> 00:18:27.840
l-it can't be!

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:30.240
Fall!

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:32.870
<i>People can understand each other, right?</i>

00:18:37.650 --> 00:18:38.580
Damn Zeta!

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:55.390
That voice.

00:18:56.540 --> 00:18:58.530
I know I heard it.

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:04.370
Fa... Katz...! Are you all right?!

00:19:04.610 --> 00:19:06.370
Kamille, what about Haman?

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:08.110
It's all right.
Don't worry about her.

00:19:08.780 --> 00:19:10.310
Katz, can you move?

00:19:10.380 --> 00:19:12.080
Yeah, I'm okay.

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:15.620
<i>Okay, protect the Methuss.</i>
<i>That's now your duty.</i>

00:19:16.020 --> 00:19:17.580
<i>But what about Haman?!</i>

00:19:17.660 --> 00:19:20.790
<i>Don't you get it?!</i>
<i>You were as good as dead!</i>

00:19:21.860 --> 00:19:22.950
<i>I'm worried about the Argama.</i>

00:19:23.030 --> 00:19:24.020
<i>I'm leaving this area to you.</i>

00:19:26.800 --> 00:19:27.560
They're fast!

00:19:27.630 --> 00:19:29.100
How many of them are there?

00:19:33.470 --> 00:19:35.070
<i>Lieutenant Emma!</i>
<i>We'll attack them from both sides!</i>

00:19:35.580 --> 00:19:36.540
Kamille!

00:19:36.980 --> 00:19:37.700
Roger!

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:44.770
<i>Lieutenant!</i>

00:19:44.850 --> 00:19:45.910
You're okay!

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:49.320
<i>Lieutenant, the enemy mobile suits</i>
<i>are like shooting fish in a barrel!</i>

00:19:49.460 --> 00:19:51.320
We'll leave this area to the Nemos.

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:53.280
We're returning to the Argama!

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:11.740
Miss Haman!

00:20:11.810 --> 00:20:14.680
All vessels have retreated as ordered!

00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:17.880
We'll attack again as soon
as the fleet regroups.

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:18.920
Yes, ma'am.

00:20:23.260 --> 00:20:26.750
Miss Mineva would like you to have these,
thanking you for...

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:28.320
...your efforts in the battle.

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:30.760
Miss Mineva does?

00:20:32.530 --> 00:20:34.930
The times are definitely changing.

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:38.770
The enemy we must destroy...

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:40.860
...is Kamille Bidan.

00:20:42.140 --> 00:20:43.840
It's as simple as that.

00:20:47.710 --> 00:20:50.200
Message from the troops
that entered Gryps 2.

00:20:50.280 --> 00:20:53.450
All remaining Axis soldiers
have surrendered.

00:20:53.550 --> 00:20:56.610
Gryps 2 is completely under
A.E.U.G. control.

00:20:56.690 --> 00:20:57.660
Over!

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:01.350
All we have to do now is change
the direction of Axis.

00:21:01.430 --> 00:21:03.400
But that won't be easy.

00:21:03.760 --> 00:21:05.890
Right. It stresses me out
just thinking about it.

00:21:05.970 --> 00:21:09.030
We're finished receiving
the mobile suit teams!

00:21:09.100 --> 00:21:10.070
Good.

00:21:10.270 --> 00:21:11.930
Tell Katz and Fa to come to the bridge.

00:21:12.270 --> 00:21:13.300
For "corrections"?

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:17.370
The Argama's proceeding
at top speed!

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:35.880
I had the chance, but I couldn't kill Haman.

00:21:36.960 --> 00:21:40.490
Don't worry about it.
I might have to do that myself.

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:41.670
No.

00:21:41.870 --> 00:21:45.770
My fragile feelings lost to
her intense will.

00:21:46.570 --> 00:21:47.940
That's all.

00:21:48.010 --> 00:21:49.530
That's dangerous, Kamille.

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:51.900
You're following in the steps
of Amuro Ray.

00:21:53.650 --> 00:21:54.840
Do you think so?

00:21:55.150 --> 00:21:59.080
It took Amuro seven years
to set his soul free. During that time...

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:01.750
...he experienced hell.

00:22:02.660 --> 00:22:03.620
Yes.

00:22:04.160 --> 00:22:05.950
Kamille! Here you are!

00:22:06.030 --> 00:22:07.990
Let's play a game of cards! You promised!

00:22:08.060 --> 00:22:09.120
Hey...!

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:11.230
Okay!

00:22:11.500 --> 00:22:13.490
- Let's go to my room!
- Let's go! Let's go!

00:22:13.570 --> 00:22:15.690
I get to deal this time!

00:22:15.770 --> 00:22:18.290
Cards! Cards! Char! Cards!

00:22:21.570 --> 00:22:24.170
Operation Maelstrom came to an end...

00:22:24.240 --> 00:22:27.040
...and the A.E.U.G. took control
of Gryps 2.

00:22:27.110 --> 00:22:29.600
However, the Argama alone pursues Axis.

00:22:30.920 --> 00:22:32.980
Their plan is to board Axis...

00:22:33.050 --> 00:22:36.390
...and alter its course away from Granada.

00:22:47.270 --> 00:22:49.600
Oh, I can't help believing you

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
kanarazu aeru to ano hi kara shinjiteita

00:22:50.480 --> 00:22:56.020
I've believed we're sure to meet again ever since that day

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
kitto yobiau kokoro ga areba

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.400
If we have heart, we'll be called together again

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
mugen no Energy yobisamasu

00:23:01.450 --> 00:23:11.790
Awaken the infinite energy

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
aa kizutsukeau mae ni

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.420
Before you get hurt

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
dekiru koto sagashite Please

00:23:17.460 --> 00:23:23.510
Find what you can do...Please

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
nagedasanai de kurushii toki koso

00:23:23.550 --> 00:23:28.680
Don't throw it away because of this painful age

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
itsuka mita aoi sora wo

00:23:29.390 --> 00:23:32.020
Until the day we gaze up again

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
kitto anata to miageru hi made

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:39.030
at the blue sky we once saw

00:23:48.030 --> 00:23:51.830
Rosamia's Psyco Gundam successfully
performs to the best of its abilities...

00:23:51.900 --> 00:23:54.370
...in exchange for Rosamia's life.

00:23:55.430 --> 00:24:00.500
However, during the battle,
Kamille would hear a nostalgic voice.

00:24:01.710 --> 00:24:06.970
Next on Mobile Suit Zeta Gundam,
"The Mirror of Rosamia".

00:24:07.050 --> 00:24:09.580
You will see the tears of time.

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
Next Episode

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:12.440
The Mirror of Rosamia
